# Allowlist for the no-research arm (ADR-0006). FilterDefaultDeny is On, so ONLY hosts
# matching a line here are permitted; every other destination is refused and logged.
# One regex per line (FilterExtended On). Anchor to avoid substring surprises.
#
# Legitimate destinations for a no-research arm:
#   - the chain RPC (here: the TestNet archive node IP used by the spikes)
#   - in production this list is per-(chain profile x arm): chain RPC + the MCP endpoint
#     (on arms that allow MCP) + the proxy itself. Exact entries are set at test time.
^192\.168\.0\.73$
